# Example only. Copy to ~/.config/groundwork/commit-denylist (or point
# GROUNDWORK_COMMIT_DENYLIST at a file) and edit it there. Never commit the
# real file. One case-insensitive substring per line, matched against
# "Name <email>" of the author and of the committer. Blank lines and lines
# starting with # are ignored.
#
# alt-account
# example-org
